{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36966","headline":"蟋蟀诗 · 罗隐","name":"蟋蟀诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顽颸毙芳，吹愁夕长。\n屑戍有动，歌离吊梦。\n如诉如言，绪引虚宽。\n周隙伺榻，繁咽夤缘。\n范睡蝉老，冠峨緌好。\n不冠不緌，尔奚以悲。\n蚊蚋有毒，食人肌肉。\n苍蝇多端，黑白偷安。\n尔也出处，物兮莫累。\n坏舍啼衰，虚堂泣曙。\n勿徇諠譁，鼠岂无牙。\n勿学萋菲，垣亦有耳。\n危条槁飞，抽恨咿咿。\n别帐缸冷，柔魂不定。\n美人在何，夜影流波。\n与子伫立，裴回思多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}